  - assembly line
  - bounding box annotation
  - small object detection
abstract: >-
  1,500 colour photographs recorded during routine work on an assembly line at
  Icam site de Strasbourg-Europe, annotated with 13,313 axis-aligned bounding
  boxes over eleven categories of components, hand-held tools and workstation
  structures. Released with the annotation protocol, a fixed train and
  validation partition, and a trained detector checkpoint. The DOI is the
  concept DOI and resolves to the newest version; this record describes v2.
